  "title": "Jetboil Zip 2.0 Fast Boil Cooking System",
  "handle": "jetboil-zip-2-0-cooking-system",
  "description": "<h3><span>Description</span></h3>\n<p>A tried-and-true classic, the Zip offers a reliable and simple cooking system for backpackers. Lightweight and compact, this system focuses on the backcountry boiling essentials. No more, and no less. Powered by FluxRing technology, the Zip's easy-to-use cooking system boils water in just 120 seconds. Jetboil's 0.8L FluxRing cooking cup with insulating cozy makes boiling water—and keeping it warm—a breeze. The bottom cover doubles as a measuring cup and a bowl, saving space in your pack for clothes, gear, and food. With Zip 0.8L you get a simple cooking system that is stowable, efficient, and affordable.<br></p>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<div class=\"tab-content col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"product-features-combined\">\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-featurebulletcombo field-type-text-long field-label-hidden\">\n<div class=\"field-items\">\n<div class=\"tab-content col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"product-features-combined\">\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-featurebulletcombo field-type-text-long field-label-hidden\">\n<div class=\"field-items\">\n<div class=\"tab-content col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"product-features-combined\">\n<div class=\"field field-name-field-featurebulletcombo field-type-text-long field-label-hidden\">\n<div class=\"field-items\">\n<ul>\n<li>New textured grip zone provides easy and intuitive handling</li>\n<li>Improved pot to burner connection with three locking points and visual indicators for peace of mind</li>\n<li>Improved easy-turn valve with position indicator, so you know exactly where your flame is set</li>\n<li>Boil water in a lightning-fast 120 seconds to enjoy your morning cup of coffee or dehydrated meals with less waiting</li>\n<li>Everything packs neatly into the Zip's cooking cup, saving pack space and keeping your gear organized</li>\n<li>FluxRing technology allows Zip to heat with extremely high efficiency and consume less fuel</li>\n<li>Zip’s bottom cover doubles as a measuring cup and bowl, saving pack space</li>\n<li>Compatible Accessories: Hanging Kit 2.0, Pot Support 2.0. Additional cookware can be used with Pot Support 2.0, like the Summit Skillet and 1.5L Ceramic Cook Pot<br>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<h3>Specifications</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Weight: 340<span>g<br></span>\n</li>\n<li><span>Capacity: 0.8L</span></li>\n<li><span>Boil Time (JetPower gas canister): 120sec per .5 liter (avg. over life of JetPower can)<br></span></li>\n<li><span>Water Boiled (Per 100 g JetPower Cannister): 10L</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span><iframe width=\"1200\" height=\"556\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a03KdprKsXI\" title=\"NEW! Jetboil Zip 0.8L Product Walkthrough\"></iframe></span></p>",
